    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the Elder\u2019s Trials</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Seasons of Solitude</i> is a turn-based survival strategy set in a hand-painted prehistoric world inspired by Estonian nature and mythology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are in exile, alone in the wild. Each handcrafted trial tests your ability to endure, secure resources, and carry them forward to unlock tools and strategies for the challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scout the Unknown:</strong> Every trial begins in uncertainty. Reveal the land tile by tile, uncovering resources you need and hazards that threaten to cut you off. The sooner you know the shape of the world, the better you can survive it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/fce68d2f8a56a17602ff34b8a09dc7b0.poster.avif?t=1755262926\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/fce68d2f8a56a17602ff34b8a09dc7b0.webm?t=1755262926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/fce68d2f8a56a17602ff34b8a09dc7b0.mp4?t=1755262926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather With Purpose:</strong>\u00a0Food, water, and materials will not last forever. Seasons turn, yields fade, and dangers spread. Take what you can while the opportunity lasts, and weigh every step against hunger, thirst, and time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/adff4277996a663f93d3a612ed670c25.poster.avif?t=1755262926\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/adff4277996a663f93d3a612ed670c25.webm?t=1755262926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/adff4277996a663f93d3a612ed670c25.mp4?t=1755262926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secure Your Gains: </strong>A resource in your hands is never truly safe. Bring your gains to shelter, where they are protected from loss and carried into the trials ahead. Every piece you store is a step toward new tools and stronger strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/a8a219baf6ad59f0282dd87a0b619a41.poster.avif?t=1755262926\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/a8a219baf6ad59f0282dd87a0b619a41.webm?t=1755262926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/a8a219baf6ad59f0282dd87a0b619a41.mp4?t=1755262926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt and Evolve</strong>: No trial stands still. A clear path today may freeze tomorrow, and each trial leaves you stronger. Unlock new tools between runs, gain new actions, and adapt your strategy as hazards roam, water dries, and frost creeps across the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/4982238731aef1d48fe3d705d2300b50.poster.avif?t=1755262926\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/4982238731aef1d48fe3d705d2300b50.webm?t=1755262926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/4982238731aef1d48fe3d705d2300b50.mp4?t=1755262926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Trial is a Puzzle</strong><br>Each handcrafted map is a survival puzzle with a single solution: out think the season before it turns on you. No randomness, just pure tactical mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasons That Fight Back</strong><br>Summer feeds you, autumn starves you. The bog slows your feet, frost blocks your path, and drought steals your water, every change demands a new plan.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Has a Memory</strong><br>What you save in one trial shapes the next. Resources carried forward unlock tools that open entirely new actions and strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Land Judges You</strong><br>Overuse it and it withers. Protect it and it thrives, rewarding you with better yields and safer paths. The ecosystem remembers your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Worth Enduring</strong><br>Hand-painted tiles inspired by Estonian nature and mythology bring the trials to life,\u00a0 every tile is beautiful, every step is dangerous.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Where Solitude Tests Your Limits</strong><br>No tribe. No second chances. Only your decisions shape your survival. Explore, adapt, and endure, the Elder is watching.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the Elder\u2019s Trials</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Seasons of Solitude</i> is a turn-based survival strategy set in a hand-painted prehistoric world inspired by Estonian nature and mythology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are in exile, alone in the wild. Each handcrafted trial tests your ability to endure, secure resources, and carry them forward to unlock tools and strategies for the challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scout the Unknown:</strong> Every trial begins in uncertainty. Reveal the land tile by tile, uncovering resources you need and hazards that threaten to cut you off. The sooner you know the shape of the world, the better you can survive it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/fce68d2f8a56a17602ff34b8a09dc7b0.poster.avif?t=1755262926\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/fce68d2f8a56a17602ff34b8a09dc7b0.webm?t=1755262926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/fce68d2f8a56a17602ff34b8a09dc7b0.mp4?t=1755262926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather With Purpose:</strong>\u00a0Food, water, and materials will not last forever. Seasons turn, yields fade, and dangers spread. Take what you can while the opportunity lasts, and weigh every step against hunger, thirst, and time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/adff4277996a663f93d3a612ed670c25.poster.avif?t=1755262926\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/adff4277996a663f93d3a612ed670c25.webm?t=1755262926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/adff4277996a663f93d3a612ed670c25.mp4?t=1755262926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secure Your Gains: </strong>A resource in your hands is never truly safe. Bring your gains to shelter, where they are protected from loss and carried into the trials ahead. Every piece you store is a step toward new tools and stronger strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/a8a219baf6ad59f0282dd87a0b619a41.poster.avif?t=1755262926\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/a8a219baf6ad59f0282dd87a0b619a41.webm?t=1755262926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/a8a219baf6ad59f0282dd87a0b619a41.mp4?t=1755262926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt and Evolve</strong>: No trial stands still. A clear path today may freeze tomorrow, and each trial leaves you stronger. Unlock new tools between runs, gain new actions, and adapt your strategy as hazards roam, water dries, and frost creeps across the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/4982238731aef1d48fe3d705d2300b50.poster.avif?t=1755262926\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/4982238731aef1d48fe3d705d2300b50.webm?t=1755262926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312670/extras/4982238731aef1d48fe3d705d2300b50.mp4?t=1755262926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Trial is a Puzzle</strong><br>Each handcrafted map is a survival puzzle with a single solution: out think the season before it turns on you. No randomness, just pure tactical mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasons That Fight Back</strong><br>Summer feeds you, autumn starves you. The bog slows your feet, frost blocks your path, and drought steals your water, every change demands a new plan.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Has a Memory</strong><br>What you save in one trial shapes the next. Resources carried forward unlock tools that open entirely new actions and strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Land Judges You</strong><br>Overuse it and it withers. Protect it and it thrives, rewarding you with better yields and safer paths. The ecosystem remembers your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Worth Enduring</strong><br>Hand-painted tiles inspired by Estonian nature and mythology bring the trials to life,\u00a0 every tile is beautiful, every step is dangerous.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Where Solitude Tests Your Limits</strong><br>No tribe. No second chances. Only your decisions shape your survival. Explore, adapt, and endure, the Elder is watching.</p>",
